rrorInSubSteps":false},{"stepId":"eb67dbfa00d8e947295e911af1a2cd91","name":"s02-list-after.md (/snf): Pass","status":"passed","steps":[{"link":{"used":true,"missed":false,"id":"642c47204c4f8f1d48bf099c2a8fd45a","originalFileName":"703b238d-805e-49b9-aa18-3ef4485db554-attachment.txt","ext":".txt","contentType":"text/plain","contentLength":2136,"name":"page snapshot (accessibility tree)"},"type":"attachment"},{"link":{"used":true,"missed":false,"id":"6777926e3ac9266add2b6ad30ba4184e","originalFileName":"35eaaef4-7bc0-4eb3-88be-dca6f0082184-attachment.png","ext":".png","contentType":"image/png","contentLength":71082,"name":"screenshot"},"type":"attachment"}],"parameters":[],"start":1791939349340,"stop":1791939349340,"duration":0,"type":"step","hasSimilarErrorInSubSteps":false},{"link":{"used":true,"missed":false,"id":"685a44d1e7eaa47e782f6c119aeb8843","originalFileName":"a28b949c-b04d-4bdf-8c02-695266c7b8c8-attachment.txt","ext":".txt","contentType":"text/plain","contentLength":2315,"name":"agent's notes (facts it saw, not a verdict)"},"type":"attachment"},{"link":{"used":true,"missed":false,"id":"0dfe3cc686b64f219aec598e55f95592","originalFileName":"b395869e-e03f-469b-abdc-c318761c7948-attachment.json","ext":".json","contentType":"application/json","contentLength":4674,"name":"oracle verdict"},"type":"attachment"}],"error":{"message":"Checked by Quinn's runner (ledger.md #61): Pass — UAT TC-06 main flow both modes: add form toggle (default Follow-up), template preselected per badge, hand override, reload, list badge"},"testCase":{"id":"7e0fcf69219b7858a7fe527b19b40ea9","externalId":"419feda10d91cc861ed3633952b30709","name":"[dev] S02 Nursing Home walk (step 7): add-form default, list badge, all three states by hand incl. back to Follow-up, pre-selection, override, reload","fullName":"TC-06 Admission Status Toggle › TC-06/S02"},"descriptionHtml":"<div class=\"rc-approach\"><p><b>思路 / Approach</b> · TC-06 Admission Status Toggle · <b>S02</b> 「养老院走一遍（第 7 步）：添加表单默认值、列表徽章、手动选全部三个状态（包括改回 Follow-up）、预选、手动改模板、重新加载」 <span class=\"notranslate\" translate=\"no\" lang=\"en\">Nursing Home walk (step 7): add-form default, list badge, all three states by hand incl. back to Follow-up, pre-selection, override, reload</span></p><p><b>覆盖的 UAT 步骤 / 票 AC：</b></p><ul><li><b>U1</b> Nothing is ever New Admission (or Consult) unless the physician set it: the app never guesses the status, and a patient nobody has set reads Follow-up（UAT TC-06）</li><li><b>U3</b> The manual add form has the three-state toggle (New Admission / Follow-up / Consult) at creation, it defaults to Follow-up, and the state chosen there (or left untouched) is the one saved（UAT TC-06；TFA-92584 AC 2；TFA-92584 AC 3）</li><li><b>U4</b> The physician can change the badge by hand at any time (before or after Generate, and on a patient whose status already rolled) through all three states, and each change persists (list, chart, reload …（UAT TC-06；TFA-92584 AC 1）</li><li><b>U8</b> The badge pre-selects the template at Generate: Hospital New Admission -&gt; H&amp;P, Follow-up -&gt; SOAP progress, Consult -&gt; Consult note; …（UAT TC-06；TFA-92584 AC 6；TFA-92584 AC 7）</li><li><b>U9</b> The physician still sees the template picker at Generate and can change the pre-selected template by hand; changing the template does not change the badge, and Generate writes the note in the templat …（UAT TC-06；TFA-92584 AC 6）</li><li><b>U12</b> All of the above works in both Hospital and Nursing Home (step 7, ground rule 3.3)（UAT TC-06；UAT 3.3；TFA-92584 AC 7）</li><li><b>T2</b> Discharge templates (Discharge summary; SNF discharge once it exists) are never pre-selected by the badge in either context; they are only chosen by hand (UAT TC-06 step 6)（UAT TC-06；TFA-92584 AC 6；TFA-92599 AC 6）</li></ul><p><b>测试设计方法：</b>主流程（happy-path） — 照 UAT / 票的原话把正常流程走一遍，该出现的都要出现。</p><p><b>Given </b>Same fixture; the Nursing Home resident nobody has set a status for</p><p><b>When </b>Repeat S01 in Nursing Home: untouched Add Resident form; resident chart Encounter tab with Follow-up, New Admission, Consult; with Consult set, override Note Format to SNF admission; reload; list; then change the status by hand back to Follow-up (step 5 in Nursing Home); list again</p><p><b>Then </b>Add form Follow-up by default; Follow-up -&gt; SNF follow-up; New Admission -&gt; SNF admission; Consult never pre-selects SNF admission or SNF discharge; the override does not change the badge; Consult survives the reload and shows on the list; the hand change to Follow-up is saved, pre-selects SNF follow-up and shows on the list</p><p><b>通过的标准（oracle，节选）：</b>UAT TC-06 step 7 (steps 1-6 in Nursing Home, including step 3 'through all three states' and step 5's hand change to Follow-up) + TFA-92584 AC 6, 7. oracle.mjs on [selected] options. Nursing Home Consult must never pre-select SNF admission or SNF discharge (U8, not gated); …</p><p><b>在哪跑：</b>dev 单元 U61；测试方法 AGENT · 浏览器 agent；矩阵里排的车道 浏览器 agent（automated）</p><p><small>S02 是我们自己编的用例号（覆盖矩阵 cases/TC-06.matrix.json 里的编号），不是 UAT 文档里的步骤号。</small></p></div><p><b>环境：dev</b> — dev 部署，build <code>e02167f</code>（Deploy Convex，2026-10-12T18:24:27Z）；账号和地址不写进报告；run folder <code>runs/2026-10-14-dev</code>。</p><p><b>测试方法：</b>AGENT · 浏览器 agent；辅助：PW · Playwright 脚本 — 按 cases/test-methods.json 的分类，分类说在 both 跑；来源：<code>dev</code>。</p><p><b>UAT item:</b> TC-06 Admission Status Toggle · <b>Section:</b> A1 · Home Screen &amp; Dashboard · <b>Scenario:</b> TC-06/S02</p><p><b>Nursing Home walk (step 7): add-form default, list badge, all three states by hand incl. back to Follow-up, pre-selection, override, reload</b></p><p><b>Tickets:</b> TFA-92584 Admission Status Toggle (ready for qa); TFA-92599 Hospital vs. Nursing-Home Context Switch (in progress)</p><p><b>Result:</b> Pass from <code>scripts/oracle.mjs</code> on the saved evidence (<code>units/U61.verdict.json</code>), unit U61 split by its parts' checkpoints. Agent: 88 turns, 217 s, $0.66.</p><p><b>Plan:</b> unit U61 (#51, rest, ui-only) — Badge walk with template pre-selection. Same legacy seed, same controls; S01 works only the Hospital patient and S02 only the resident, so neither touches the other's chart. Runs together with TC-06/S01.</p><p><b>Checked by Quinn's runner</b> (<code>ledger.md</code> #61, U61; checked: yes): <b>Pass</b> — UAT TC-06 main flow both modes: add form toggle (default Follow-up), template preselected per badge, hand override, reload, list badge</p>","environment":"default","setup":[],"teardown":[],"history":[],"retries":[],"breadcrumbs":[["TC-06 Admission Status Toggle","S02 Nursing Home walk (step 7): add-form default, list badge, all three states by hand incl. back to Fo…"]],"retry":false,"titlePath":[],"retriesCount":0,"attachments":[{"link":{"used":true,"missed":false,"id":"ef4b097be756ea3d5e0afad3eaf4c619","originalFileName":"253f1a9a-ade2-4939-84e9-4803576e6d17-attachment.txt","ext":".txt","contentType":"text/plain","contentLength":1547,"name":"page snapshot (accessibility tree)"},"type":"attachment"},{"link":{"used":true,"missed":false,"id":"f61a64010b937eb98fd1162e76ae2c6c","originalFileName":"32986170-1fd2-4993-b2d4-9076a86deed9-attachment.png","ext":".png","contentType":"image/png","contentLength":51124,"name":"screenshot"},"type":"attachment"},{"link":{"used":true,"missed":false,"id":"7278a6595797d7ee3047f1b3dc34c92d","originalFileName":"5c9743b7-349e-4b08-b4d2-1e99428ede3a-attachment.txt","ext":".txt","contentType":"text/plain","contentLength":2136,"name":"page snapshot (accessibility tree)"},"type":"attachment"},{"link":{"id":"5bdf289c82325c99acc7fedec272995c","originalFileName":"f8c65ad5-0869-40be-bbc3-df69df9bfcb5-attachment.png","ext":".png","name":"screenshot","contentType":"image/png","used":true,"missed":false,"contentLength":71082},"type":"attachment"},{"link":{"used":true,"missed":false,"id":"eb2ee54ab31666b051a160cc3e1b8f00","originalFileName":"0b86e63d-ce73-4e92-a0a3-fc777de0ec35-attachment.txt","ext":".txt","contentType":"text/plain","content